			"color":"#322",
			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young East Asian woman in <Picture 1>, with dark hair tied in a low ponytail with loose bangs and stray strands, wearing a soft fuzzy pink sweater with a Fair Isle pattern in navy blue and white zigzag and diamond stripes, and a dark plaid skirt visible at the bottom of the frame. She has a sweet, youthful face with a gentle smile.\n<Subject 2> is the bedroom environment in <Picture 1>, featuring a bed with white pillows and white bedding, a beige wall in the background, a dark wooden headboard partially visible, and warm soft sunlight streaming in from the side, casting a golden glow and gentle shadows.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 1> (S1), a sweet, clear young female voice with a soft, airy quality and a warm, gentle tone — light and youthful with a natural breathiness, suitable for gentle pop or indie-folk singing.\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1], establishing the initial medium-shot composition with the woman sitting on the bed, raising her right hand in a cute finger-heart gesture near her head, and smiling warmly at the camera.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + keyframe completion + audio reference] The target video is an 8-second intimate music-video style clip beginning from <Picture 1>, in which <Subject 1>, the young woman in the pink Fair Isle sweater, sits on the bed in <Subject 2>, her sunlit bedroom, lowers her playful hand gesture, and begins to sing softly. Her singing voice follows the sweet, airy timbre of <Audio 1>. The camera gently pushes in as she sings, with warm sunlight flickering across her face and stray hairs drifting in the quiet air, creating a cozy, dreamy bedroom-concert atmosphere.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the woman's facial features, ponytail hairstyle, pink Fair Isle sweater, and overall youthful appearance are retained exactly as in the reference.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the bed, white pillows, beige wall, wooden headboard, and warm side-lighting are retained in their original composition.\n<Audio 1>: reference - <Subject 1>'s singing voice follows <Audio 1>'s sweet, clear, airy young female timbre and gentle delivery without copying the original signal.\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, camera angle, subject pose, hand gesture, smile, and warm lighting match the reference image exactly at 0.00 seconds.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a warm, soft cinematic aesthetic with shallow depth of field, golden natural lighting, and a cozy intimate atmosphere — consistent with the reference image's gentle, dreamy quality.\n[Shot 1] The video opens on the exact composition of <Picture 1>: a medium shot of <Subject 1>, the young woman in the pink fuzzy Fair Isle sweater, sitting on the white bed in <Subject 2>, her sunlit bedroom. She holds her right hand up near her head in a cute finger-heart gesture, smiling warmly and looking directly at the camera. Warm golden sunlight catches the fuzzy texture of her sweater and the stray strands of her hair. The camera holds for a moment, then begins a slow, gentle push-in with small amplitude at a soft pace. Gradually, she lowers her right hand from the finger-heart gesture, letting it rest lightly on her lap. Her smile softens into a more tender expression, and her lips part as she begins to sing — her mouth shapes the opening notes of a gentle melody, using the sweet, clear, airy young female timbre referenced from <Audio 1>. Her eyes remain warm and engaged, and a few stray hairs drift softly in the quiet air. The sunlight flickers subtly across her face as if a cloud is passing outside the window.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500, the shot continues the push-in, now a medium close-up centered on <Subject 1>'s face and upper body. She sings with her eyes partially closed, lost in the gentle melody, her lips moving naturally with the lyrics in the sweet, breathy voice timbre of <Audio 1>. Her shoulders sway slightly with the rhythm, and her left hand rises slowly to rest near her chest, fingers gently curled. The golden sunlight intensifies, creating a warm halo around her hair and soft bokeh highlights on the wall behind her. She tilts her head slightly, a quiet smile playing at the corners of her mouth as she reaches the chorus of the phrase. The camera settles into a soft close-up of her face, eyes still closed, as she holds a sustained note — her voice clear and warm, the final sound lingering in the air. The golden light fills the frame with a cozy glow as the video reaches its 8-second mark, with her expression serene and completely transported by the song.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet bedroom ambience underlies the scene: a very faint distant traffic hum, the soft rustle of the sweater fabric as she moves, and gentle breath sounds between phrases. The room tone is warm and still, emphasizing the intimacy of her singing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA soft, gentle acoustic guitar fingerpicking pattern at a slow tempo, paired with a warm upright bass and delicate glockenspiel accents that sparkle softly beneath her voice. The instrumentation is sparse and intimate, mixing gently with her singing to create a cozy bedroom-pop atmosphere that swells subtly on the chorus before settling back to a warm, quiet fade."
